<title>UK: Schleswig-Holstein Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Schleswig-Holstein Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEINISCHE LANDSCHAFT HYPOBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.50	MATURITY    16.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE REX-LINKED	ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST YEAR THEN COUPON LINKED TO REX 10-YEAR</p>
<p>YIELD</p>
<p>		SUBINDEX TIMES 80 PCT.</p>
<p>		PFANDBRIEF SERIES 642</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
